              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Interval ==30s== (fast 10s)",
                "Unhealthy after ==3 failures==",
                "Private resource: use a ==CloudWatch alarm== check"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. CloudFront",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Behaviours match ==in order==; Default (*) is last",
                "ACM cert must be in ==us-east-1==",
                "Cache key = ==what you forward==",
                "Prefer ==versioned file names== over invalidating",
                "OAC works with the S3 ==REST endpoint== only"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
